Thai Waters Rev F | erm_running_equivalent
* 50.0 ohm, 0.6 mH, 3.0 V differential command.
* Model: Electrical RL/envelope surrogate. 50 ohm is effective running load at 3 V/60 mA, not measured winding DCR; low R represents an uncertain starting/stall stress.
Vdrive drv 0 DC 0 PULSE(0 3 1m 5u 5u 6m 20m)
Lmotor drv series 0.6m
Rmotor series 0 50
.TRAN 5u 9m 0 5u
.PRINT TRAN I(Vdrive)
.END
